---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Now" description="What's running in the lab and what I'm thinking about right now. Model data refreshes nightly.">
<style>
.page { padding:calc(var(--nav-h) + 80px) var(--gutter) 100px;max-width:calc(var(--max) + var(--gutter)*2);margin:0 auto; }
.section-label { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.64rem;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:52px; }
.section-label::before { content:'';width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--amber); }
.section-label::after { content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--amber-border); }
h1 { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:14px; }
h1 em { font-style:italic;color:var(--amber); }
.sub { color:var(--text-2);font-size:1rem;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.7; }
.stamp { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:64px; }
h2 { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 24px; }
.thinking { max-width:680px;margin-bottom:80px; }
.thinking p { color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.82;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:.98rem; }
.thinking a { color:var(--amber);border-bottom:1px solid var(--amber-border); }
.status-list { display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--amber-border);margin-bottom:80px; }
.status-row { display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(160px,1fr) 2fr auto;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:22px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--amber-border);transition:background .2s; }
.status-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
a.status-row:hover { background:var(--bg-2); }
.st-name { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em; }
.st-detail { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;color:var(--text-2);letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7; }
.st-state { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap; }
.s-dot { width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#4caf50;animation:pulse 2s infinite; }
.s-dot.amber { background:var(--amber); }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.4} }
.latest { display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:680px; }
.latest a { display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:baseline;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--amber-border);transition:padding-left .2s; }
.latest a:hover { padding-left:8px; }
.latest a:hover .lt-title { color:var(--amber); }
.lt-date { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.07em; }
.lt-title { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em;transition:color .2s; }
@media(max-width:720px) { .status-row { grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px; } }
</style>

<Nav variant="full" active="/now" />

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-label">Now</div>
  <h1>What's running<br><em>right now.</em></h1>
  <p class="sub">The live systems in the lab, and what I'm currently thinking about. Model numbers refresh nightly; the thinking refreshes when it changes.</p>
  <div class="stamp">Model data as of 2026-08-19 · Page updated 2026-08-20</div>

  <div class="thinking">
    <h2>Currently thinking about</h2>
    <p>Agentic identity. AI agents authenticate with borrowed credentials, act with delegated authority, and leave audit trails that point at their humans. I'm building an intent-token layer on existing standards — RFC 8693 token exchange, SPIFFE workload identity — to attest not just <em>who</em> an agent is but <em>why</em> it's acting, and working it toward an open-source package and a paper. The recent essays <a href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who">The Credential Remembers Who</a> and <a href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</a> lay out the argument.</p>
    <p>Also in progress: an essay on retiring Vessel — what it means to end an AI persona you built, and what that taught me about agent identity. The recharter of this site is part of the same story.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Live systems</h2>
  <div class="status-list">
    <!-- now:quant -->
    <a class="status-row" href="/projects/quant-trading">
      <span class="st-name">Quant scanner</span>
      <span class="st-detail">100 symbols scanned daily · 8 positions open · defensive rotation thesis</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot amber"></span>Paper trading</span>
    </a>
    <!-- now:crypto -->
    <a class="status-row" href="/projects/crypto-model">
      <span class="st-name">Crypto model</span>
      <span class="st-detail">21 assets scored daily · 0 buy signals · Fear &amp; Greed 46 — neutral</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot"></span>Live</span>
    </a>
    <!-- now:pokemon -->
    <a class="status-row" href="/projects/pokemon-model">
      <span class="st-name">Pokémon model</span>
      <span class="st-detail">17,428 cards · 168 sets · top 25 targets updated daily</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot"></span>Live</span>
    </a>
    <!-- now:onepiece -->
    <a class="status-row" href="/projects/onepiece-model">
      <span class="st-name">One Piece model</span>
      <span class="st-detail">1,035 cards · 43 sets · 2 BUY / 88 WATCH / 372 HOLD</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot"></span>Live</span>
    </a>
    <!-- now:gpk -->
    <a class="status-row" href="/projects/gpk-model">
      <span class="st-name">Garbage Pail Kids model</span>
      <span class="st-detail">11,580 cards tracked · 7,206 scored · 114 sets, 1985–2025</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot"></span>Live</span>
    </a>
    <!-- now:building -->
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="st-name">Building</span>
      <span class="st-detail">agentic-id package (intent tokens) · Harvest Haven (Roblox, with my son) · Perimeter OS</span>
      <span class="st-state"><span class="s-dot amber"></span>In progress</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Latest writing</h2>
  <div class="latest">
    <a href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who"><span class="lt-date">Jul 2026</span><span class="lt-title">The Credential Remembers Who. Nothing Remembers Why.</span></a>
    <a href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session"><span class="lt-date">Jul 2026</span><span class="lt-title">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</span></a>
    <a href="/writing/pokemon-card-market"><span class="lt-date">Jun 2026</span><span class="lt-title">The Card Market Has a Data Problem</span></a>
  </div>
</div>

<Footer copy="Ryan Silver's independent research lab. Built in public." />
</Base>
